<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0a1726" />
<title>The Butler Blueprint — V Villas Phuket Executive Summary</title>
<style>
:root{--ink:#0a1726;--ink2:#14283e;--ivory:#f5f1e9;--paper:#fbfaf7;--gold:#b89552;--gold2:#d4bb82;--line:rgba(184,149,82,.34);--muted:#6f746f;--shadow:0 28px 80px rgba(3,11,20,.18)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;background:var(--ink)}
body{margin:0;color:var(--ink);background:var(--ivory);font-family:"Leelawadee UI","Noto Sans Thai",Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.72;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit}
button{font:inherit}
.serif{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif}
.shell{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 64px));margin:auto}
.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold)}
.gold{color:var(--gold)}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}

/* top rail */
.rail{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:60;height:66px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,13,23,.82),rgba(5,13,23,.28),transparent);color:#fff;transition:.3s}
.rail.scrolled{background:rgba(8,19,32,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.rail-in{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}
.brand-mini{font:700 12px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}
.nav{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}
.nav a{text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.76)}
.nav a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);color:#fff}
.print{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.24);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;padding:8px 13px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}
.print:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}

/* page 1 */
.hero{min-height:100svh;position:relative;display:grid;align-items:end;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ink)}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,14,25,.91) 0%,rgba(5,14,25,.75) 38%,rgba(5,14,25,.28) 72%,rgba(5,14,25,.12) 100%),linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(5,14,25,.65),transparent 45%),url('data:image/webp;base64,');background-size:cover;background-position:center;transform:scale(1.015)}
.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 76% 24%,rgba(221,192,126,.14),transparent 26%),linear-gradient(135deg,transparent 72%,rgba(184,149,82,.10));pointer-events:none}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;color:#fff;padding:104px 0 62px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:64px;align-items:end}
.logo-card{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(251,250,247,.94);padding:14px 20px;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);margin-bottom:34px}
.logo-card img{width:102px;height:auto;display:block}
.hero h1{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-size:clamp(52px,7.2vw,94px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:8px 0 16px;font-weight:500}
.hero h1 span{display:block;color:var(--gold2);font-style:italic;font-size:.76em;margin-top:11px}
.hero .sub{max-width:760px;font-size:18px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);margin:0 0 24px}
.hero .tagline{display:flex;gap:11px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pill{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 13px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.04em}
.hero-side{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.20);padding-left:34px;margin-bottom:6px}
.hero-side .num{font:500 54px Georgia,serif;color:var(--gold2);line-height:1}
.hero-side p{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.74);margin:8px 0 27px;max-width:260px}
.scroll-cue{position:absolute;z-index:4;right:32px;bottom:28px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.54);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;writing-mode:vertical-rl;text-transform:uppercase}
.scroll-cue:after{content:"";display:inline-block;height:62px;width:1px;background:linear-gradient(var(--gold),transparent);margin-top:12px}

/* editorial sections */
.page{position:relative;min-height:100svh;padding:100px 0 90px;background:var(--paper);overflow:hidden}
.page.dark{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}
.page-no{position:absolute;right:5.2vw;top:70px;font:500 clamp(90px,14vw,190px)/1 Georgia,serif;color:rgba(184,149,82,.075);letter-spacing:-.07em;user-select:none}
.section-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:180px 1fr;gap:34px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:54px}
.section-head h2{font:500 clamp(34px,4.6vw,62px)/1.05 Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0;max-width:820px}
.section-head p{margin:8px 0 0;max-width:820px;color:#6b716f}
.dark .section-head p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.66)}
.kicker{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}

/* why now */
.why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.07fr .93fr;gap:28px;align-items:stretch}
.editorial-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e1d4;padding:38px;box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(26,34,40,.07)}
.editorial-card p{font-size:15px;color:#3f4645;margin:0 0 15px}
.award-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid #e6ded0;border-bottom:1px solid #e6ded0;margin:25px 0}
.award{padding:18px 14px;border-right:1px solid #e6ded0}
.award:last-child{border-right:none}
.award .year{font:500 25px Georgia,serif;color:var(--gold)}
.award strong{display:block;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.35}
.award small{font-size:10px;color:#888}
.award.dim{background:#f5f2ec}
.hypothesis{margin-top:24px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:30px 32px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hypothesis:after{content:"“";position:absolute;right:18px;top:-28px;font:160px Georgia,serif;color:rgba(184,149,82,.12)}
.hypothesis .label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold2)}
.hypothesis h3{font:500 26px/1.33 Georgia,serif;margin:9px 0 10px;max-width:620px}
.hypothesis p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);margin:0;font-size:13px}
.photo-stack{display:grid;grid-template-rows:1.08fr .92fr;gap:16px;min-height:690px}
.photo{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#ddd;min-height:250px}
.photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.photo:hover img{transform:scale(1.035)}
.photo .caption{position:absolute;left:18px;bottom:16px;color:#fff;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(6,15,26,.55);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);padding:7px 10px}
.insight-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:#e4dccd;margin-top:28px;border:1px solid #e4dccd}
.insight-line div{background:#f8f6f1;padding:19px 18px}
.insight-line b{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:5px}
.insight-line span{font-size:11px;color:#777}

/* propose */
.propose-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.68fr 1.32fr;gap:42px;align-items:start}
.sticky-note{position:sticky;top:94px}
.sticky-note .big{font:500 44px/1.03 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 16px}
.sticky-note p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);font-size:14px}
.micro-rule{height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),transparent);margin:28px 0}
.pill-dark{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid rgba(212,187,130,.35);color:var(--gold2);padding:7px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:8px}
.pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}
.pillar{position:relative;padding:28px 28px 27px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.06),rgba(255,255,255,.018));min-height:210px;overflow:hidden}
.pillar .n{font:500 35px Georgia,serif;color:var(--gold2);opacity:.88}
.pillar h3{font:500 21px Georgia,serif;margin:9px 0 7px}
.pillar p{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.60);margin:0}
.pillar:after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-35px;bottom:-35px;width:115px;height:115px;border:1px solid rgba(184,149,82,.13);border-radius:50%}
.journey{margin-top:30px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);padding-top:28px}
.journey-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:20px;margin-bottom:18px}
.journey h3{font:500 28px Georgia,serif;margin:0}
.journey-meta{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);letter-spacing:.08em}
.days{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.day{padding:25px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,.035)}
.day .d{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold2);font-weight:700}
.day h4{font:500 18px/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:7px 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase}
.day b{font-size:13px;color:#fff}
.day p{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.58);margin:7px 0 0}
.secret{margin-top:14px;padding:18px 20px;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(184,149,82,.08);font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.76)}
.flow{margin-top:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.flow span{font:500 11px Georgia,serif;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.11);padding:9px 12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.77)}
.flow i{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal}

/* outcomes */
.outcome-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.06fr .94fr;gap:32px}
.outcome-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid #ded6c8;border-left:1px solid #ded6c8}
.outcome{padding:23px 24px;border-right:1px solid #ded6c8;border-bottom:1px solid #ded6c8;background:#fff}
.outcome b{font:700 10px/1.2 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--gold);display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
.outcome h4{font:500 18px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 6px}
.outcome p{font-size:11px;color:#6f7471;margin:0}
.time-card{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:34px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:100%}
.time-card:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:auto -20% -25% 30%;height:70%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(184,149,82,.17),transparent 62%)}
.time-card .super{font:500 clamp(45px,6vw,82px)/.92 Georgia,serif;color:var(--gold2);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:16px 0 22px}
.time-card p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);font-size:13px;position:relative}
.time-card blockquote{margin:26px 0 0;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);font:500 19px/1.45 Georgia,serif;position:relative}
.northstar{margin-top:34px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:28px;align-items:center}
.northstar-img{height:320px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.northstar-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.northstar-copy h3{font:500 32px/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 12px}
.northstar-copy p{font-size:13px;color:#686f6d;margin:0 0 10px}
.calibration{margin-top:34px;padding:30px 32px;background:#eee8dd;border-top:1px solid var(--gold);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .95fr;gap:28px;align-items:start}
.calibration h3{font:500 27px/1.18 Georgia,serif;margin:7px 0 10px}
.calibration p{font-size:12px;color:#5f6664;margin:0 0 9px}
.info-chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:15px}
.info-chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfd6c7;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10px;color:#646a67}
.final-line{margin-top:34px;border-top:1px solid #d7cebf;padding-top:26px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;align-items:flex-end}
.final-line .quote{font:500 clamp(24px,3vw,38px)/1.14 Georgia,serif;max-width:720px}
.final-line small{display:block;color:#8b8e88;max-width:290px;font-size:9px;line-height:1.6;text-align:right}

/* source ribbon */
.source-note{font-size:9px;color:#979991;margin-top:18px}
.source-note strong{color:#6b6f6b}

/* reveal */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
.reveal.show{opacity:1;transform:none}

@media(max-width:850px){
 .shell{width:min(100% - 34px,720px)}
 .nav a{display:none}
 .hero-content,.why-grid,.propose-layout,.outcome-grid,.northstar,.calibration{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .hero-content{gap:34px;padding-top:100px}
 .hero-side{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:25px 0 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
 .hero-side p{margin-bottom:0}
 .section-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:13px}
 .pillars{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .photo-stack{min-height:540px}
 .insight-line{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
 .sticky-note{position:static}
 .outcome-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .days{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .award-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
 .award:nth-child(2){border-right:none}
 .award{border-bottom:1px solid #e6ded0}
 .final-line{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}
 .final-line small{text-align:left}
}

@media print{
 @page{size:A4;margin:0}
 body{background:#fff}
 .rail,.scroll-cue{display:none!important}
 .hero,.page{min-height:297mm;height:297mm;width:210mm;padding:18mm 15mm;page-break-after:always;overflow:hidden}
 .hero{padding:0}
 .hero-content{padding:26mm 15mm 18mm}
 .hero h1{font-size:54pt}
 .page-no{font-size:90pt}
 .section-head{margin-bottom:8mm}
 .section-head h2{font-size:28pt}
 .editorial-card{padding:7mm}
 .why-grid{gap:6mm}
 .photo-stack{min-height:125mm}
 .insight-line{margin-top:5mm}
 .propose-layout{gap:7mm}
 .pillar{min-height:42mm;padding:6mm}
 .northstar-img{height:55mm}
 .calibration{padding:6mm;margin-top:6mm}
 .reveal{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="rail" id="rail">
  <div class="rail-in">
    <div class="brand-mini">THE BUTLER BLUEPRINT</div>
    <div class="nav">
      <a href="#why">01 WHY NOW</a><a href="#propose">02 WHAT WE PROPOSE</a><a href="#gains">03 WHAT V VILLAS GAINS</a>
      <button class="print" onclick="window.print()">PRINT / SAVE PDF</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="shell hero-content">
    <div>
      <div class="logo-card"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="V Villas Phuket MGallery logo"></div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Executive Summary · Concept Preview</div>
      <h1>The Butler <span>Blueprint</span></h1>
      <p class="sub">จาก Award-Winning Hospitality สู่ Bespoke Service ที่ส่งมอบได้อย่างสม่ำเสมอ — ผ่านการพัฒนา Middle Management ที่ใช้ Digital & AI เพื่อเสริม “การรู้ใจ” ไม่ใช่แทนที่มัน</p>
      <div class="tagline"><span class="pill">V Villas Phuket · MGallery Collection</span><span class="pill">2-Day Immersive Learning Journey</span><span class="pill">Middle Management · 15–20 คน</span></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-side">
      <div><div class="num">24/7</div><p>Butler Service เป็นส่วนหนึ่งของ guest proposition ในทุก private pool villa</p></div>
      <div><div class="num">26</div><p>Private pool villas — จาก 1 ถึง 6 bedrooms บน Ao Yon Bay</p></div>
      <div><div class="num">01</div><p>คำถามที่เราเริ่มจาก: Competitive Edge ถัดไปของ V Villas ควรเป็นอะไร?</p></div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-cue">Scroll to discover</div>
</header>

<section class="page" id="why">
  <div class="page-no">01</div>
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="kicker">WHY NOW</div>
      <div><h2>จากความสำเร็จที่ได้รับการยอมรับ สู่ <span class="gold">Competitive Edge</span> ถัดไป</h2><p>เราไม่ได้เริ่มจากคำถามว่า “อยากให้สอนอะไร” แต่เริ่มจากสิ่งที่ V Villas ทำได้ดีอยู่แล้ว — และมองหาว่าความโดดเด่นนั้นจะถูกส่งต่อให้แข็งแรงขึ้นได้อย่างไร</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-grid">
      <article class="editorial-card reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">A STRATEGIC REFLECTION POINT</div>
        <p>V Villas Phuket มีรากฐานที่แข็งแรงทั้ง Luxury Hospitality, Dining Experience และ Personalized Service โดยเฉพาะ 24-hour Butler Service ซึ่ง Factsheet ของโรงแรมระบุเป็นส่วนหนึ่งของประสบการณ์ในทุก villa.</p>
        <div class="award-strip">
          <div class="award"><div class="year">2023</div><strong>Best Breakfast or Brunch</strong><small>Condé Nast Johansens</small></div>
          <div class="award"><div class="year">2024</div><strong>Best Dining Experience</strong><small>Condé Nast Johansens</small></div>
          <div class="award"><div class="year">2025</div><strong>Best Restaurant</strong><small>Condé Nast Johansens</small></div>
          <div class="award dim"><div class="year">2026</div><strong>A moment to ask “what next?”</strong><small>ไม่ตีความว่า standard ลดลง</small></div>
        </div>
        <p>การไม่ได้รับรางวัลในปีใดปีหนึ่งไม่ได้หมายความว่ามาตรฐานลดลง แต่เป็นจังหวะที่น่าสนใจสำหรับคำถามเชิงกลยุทธ์ว่า <b>Competitive Edge ถัดไปของ V Villas ควรเป็นอะไร?</b></p>
        <p>จากการศึกษา Guest Voice สิ่งที่ถูกจดจำอย่างเด่นชัดคือ Butler — การตอบสนองเร็ว การวางแผนกิจกรรม การสร้าง Surprise การใส่ใจรายละเอียด และการคาดการณ์ความต้องการก่อนถูกขอ ขณะเดียวกันบางรีวิวสะท้อนโอกาสในการทำให้ประสบการณ์นั้นต่อเนื่องยิ่งขึ้น เช่น Pre-arrival handover, experience recommendation และ service recovery.</p>
        <div class="hypothesis">
          <div class="label">OUR WORKING HYPOTHESIS</div>
          <h3>V Villas ไม่ได้ขาด Service Excellence — โอกาสสำคัญคือทำให้ Excellence ที่มีอยู่ <span class="gold">ถ่ายทอดและเกิดขึ้นได้อย่างสม่ำเสมอ</span></h3>
          <p>ไม่ว่าจะเป็น Butler คนใด · อยู่ Shift ใด · Guest Journey เชื่อมต่อกี่แผนก · หรือวันที่ผู้ที่รู้จักแขกดีที่สุดไม่ได้อยู่ปฏิบัติงาน</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="photo-stack reveal">
        <figure class="photo" style="margin:0"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="V Villas butler service"><figcaption class="caption">The human moment · V Villas Factsheet</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="photo" style="margin:0"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Yon Ocean House"><figcaption class="caption">Award-winning foundation · Dining</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="insight-line reveal">
      <div><b>จาก “คนเก่ง”</b><span>ความรู้จำนวนมากอยู่ใน Tacit Knowledge</span></div>
      <div><b>สู่ “ความรู้ของทีม”</b><span>Capture · Transfer · Retrieve</span></div>
      <div><b>สู่ “Service Continuity”</b><span>ข้อมูลไม่ reset เมื่อคนหรือกะเปลี่ยน</span></div>
      <div><b>สู่ “Guest Experience”</b><span>Technology สนับสนุน — Human Touch เป็นผู้ส่งมอบ</span></div>
    </div>
